<title>USA: Atlanta Fed business index 4.0 in Aug vs -1.2 July.</title>
<headline>Atlanta Fed business index 4.0 in Aug vs -1.2 July.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Reserve Bank of Atlanta said its diffusion index of industry business activity rose to 4.0 in August from a revised -1.2 in July.</p>
<p>The production index rose to 11.1 in August from a revised 7.9 in the previous month.</p>
<p>					   August	   July revised</p>
<p>Industry Business Index		4.0		  - 1.2</p>
<p>Production Index			11.1		    7.9</p>
<p>Prices Received			- 1.8		  - 5.5</p>
<p>Prices Paid			     12.2		   11.5</p>
<p>Backlog of Orders		    -12.5		  - 5.3</p>
<p>New Orders				 3.7		    2.0</p>
<p>Shipments				 14.0		    4.3</p>
<p>Employment			     - 0.5		    9.4</p>
<p>Inventories of Finished Goods    -18.6		  -16.6</p>
<p>Materials Inventories		-11.2		  - 2.2</p>
